            "title": "Redis Streams Metrics",
            "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
            "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "## Redis Streams Metrics\n\nRedis Streams metrics will be populated once custom counters are added to the services.\n\nExpected metrics (using `sentinel_*` prefix):\n- `sentinel_stream_messages_published_total` — messages published per stream (labels: `stream`)\n- `sentinel_stream_messages_consumed_total` — messages consumed per stream/consumer group\n- `sentinel_stream_consumer_lag` — current consumer group lag per stream\n- `sentinel_stream_publish_errors_total` — publish error counter\n\nStreams used by SENTINEL:\n- `mempool:txs` — raw transaction feed from mempool-monitor\n- `detections:alerts` — detection alerts from detection-engine\n- `defenses:actions` — defense actions from defense-agent"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "Services Using Redis",
            "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
                    "expr": "count(up{job=~\"mempool-monitor|detection-engine|defense-agent\"} == 1)",
                    "refId": "A"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
                    "thresholds": {
                        "steps": [
                            { "color": "red", "value": null },
                            { "color": "yellow", "value": 2 },
                            { "color": "green", "value": 3 }
                        ]
                    }
                }
            },
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
                "colorMode": "background",
                "textMode": "auto"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "sentinel_stream_* metrics (placeholder — no data until custom counters added)",
            "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
                    "expr": "{__name__=~\"sentinel_stream_.*\"}",
                    "legendFormat": "{{__name__}} {{job}}",
                    "refId": "A"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
                }
            },
            "options": { "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
        }
    ],
